{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10350010","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10350010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1035001001:1":{"text":"방금 곤히 자고 있는데, 누군가 황급히 지나가는 느낌이 들었어요.","source_cn":"刚才我睡得正香，恍惚间好像感觉到什么人在赶路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E5FDC7B74B1DBA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035001002:1":{"text":"아주 급했는지 길을 재촉하면서 뭐라고 소리도 질렀죠.","source_cn":"他好像很着急，一边赶路一边喊着什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67F72599346BB0BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035001003:1":{"text":"그 사람이 지나가면서 일으킨 바람 때문에 잠에서 깬 게 분명한데,","source_cn":"那人定是脚下生风，都把我吹醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAE42E48B38C87A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035001004:1":{"text":"눈을 떠보니 주위에 아무도 없는 거예요... 이상하지 않아요?","source_cn":"可我睁开眼，周围却连个人影都没有……你说怪不？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59FD0164DB84CA88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民希拉姆":{"text":"히람","source":"村民希拉姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}